n india a full  stack  engineer can earn approximately 600 000  rupees per annum  in the united states they can earn  approximately one or six  thousand dollars per annum  let's now talk about how you can become  a network architect  a computer network connects a group of  computers enabling them to communicate  with each other  this network forms the bedrock of  everything related to i.t  a network architect sets up such a  connection  so who is a network architect a network  architect  is someone who plays an important role  in handling communication networks  like lan van and the intranet  they use their in-depth knowledge  regarding the network to ensure its  proper functioning  let's now have a look at the skills  required to become a network architect  first it is to understand the different  networking concepts  an understanding of different networks  and architectures like one  lan and so on needs to be known to  understand  how they can be integrated into the  system to satisfy business needs  next a network engineer needs to have an  understanding of the tools that will  enable them to set up  a workflow and easily identify potential  network problems  they'll need to be responsible for  managing all the major aspects of the  network  analyzing problems before they arise  troubleshooting them if they do  ensuring network safety to develop  automated functions  and much more a network architect also  needs to have some experience with  project management  an understanding of project management  concepts of budgeting  and scheduling to ensure they are able  to deliver advanced network solutions to  organizations  as usual an understanding of programming  languages  methods for virtualization and excellent  communication skills  are seen as hugely beneficial  now let's talk about the  responsibilities of a network architect  a network architect designs tests and  inspects communication systems  he or she is responsible for modeling  the network  analyzing and planning it he or she  maintains  and administers computer networks and  related environments  they analyze engineer and execute  software functions and have to set up  hardware like cables routers adapters  and so on they'll need to regularly  perform disaster recovery  and make adjustments to ensure the  network performance remains consistent  let's now talk about the salary of a  network architect  according to glassdoor in india a  network architect can earn approximately  17 lakh rupees per annum  in the united states they can earn  approximately 84  000 dollars per annum if getting your  learning started is half the battle  what if you could do that for free visit  scale up by simply learn  click on the link in the description to  know more  next up we are going to talk about  devops engineer  devops combines the efforts of the  operations and development teams to  deliver services  and applications at greater speed  helping products  evolve and improve at a faster rate as  compared to traditional software  management methods  why become a devops engineer according  to the devops  institute 42 percent of global  enterprises are applying devops  at the project or multiple project level  which means  they are looking for skilled individuals  to take up that responsibility  an individual like a devops engineer  let's now talk about who is a devops  engineer a devops engineer  is someone who coordinates with both the  development  and the operations team in an  organization  thanks to their deep understanding of  the software life cycle  he or she uses this collaboration  between teams  to oversee or facilitate product  releases  and perform deployments in the manner of  continuous integration  or deployment now  for the skills required to become a  devops engineer  first a devops engineer needs to have an  understanding of scripting in languages  like python and ruby enabling you to  provision  and manage infrastructure you will need  experience handling devops 